{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25837","headline":"却到浙西 · 李绅","name":"却到浙西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临平水竭蒹葭死，里社萧条旅馆秋。\n尝叹晋郊无乞籴，岂忘吴俗共分忧。\n野悲扬目称嗟食，林极翳桑顾所求。\n苛政尚存犹惕息，老人偷拜拥前舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25837.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25837","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}